[{"answer":"I go to the movies almost every week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, I rent movies from the video store.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My favorite films are action films.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to watch car chases.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I like it when the bad guy has a shootout with the good guys.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the good guys to win.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I also like science fiction movies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I like things that take place in the future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I like movies that have aliens from different planets in them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the science fiction movies can be silly and unbelievable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't like those ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/11.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother likes dramas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/12.mp3"},{"answer":"She has a lot of favorite actors and actresses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/13.mp3"},{"answer":"She sometimes watches sad movies that make her cry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/14.mp3"},{"answer":"She also likes comedies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/15.mp3"},{"answer":"She laughs out loud if a comedy is very funny.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My father likes horror movies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/17.mp3"},{"answer":"He likes movies with monsters in them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/18.mp3"},{"answer":"He also likes thrillers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I have watched some thrillers that keep you tense and on the edge of your seat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, I have to shut my eyes if the movie gets too scary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/21.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother likes animated films.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/22.mp3"},{"answer":"In animated films, there are no actors, just cartoon characters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/23.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother goes to the movies on Saturday afternoons with his friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/24.mp3"},{"answer":"He goes to the matinee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/25.mp3"},{"answer":"He gets popcorn, candy and pop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/26.mp3"},{"answer":"He usually comes back with a stomachache because he eats so much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, my father watches documentaries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Documentaries are about real things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/29.mp3"},{"answer":"You can learn a lot from watching a documentary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I watch documentaries with him sometimes, but I would rather see a good action film.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/30-movies-2019-03-20-09-25-36/31.mp3"}]
